      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Writing the vector of residuals as $\\mathbf{e} = \\mathbf{y} - \\mathbf{X}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ gives the resulting likelihood for $\\beta$ and $\\mathbf{V}$, conditional on the observed data $(\\mathbf{y}, \\mathbf{X})$, as",
