      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "43d9b2bb99caaa1155152a2dd70c1abb451715717a24d12d6a9a8be374ecfaf6"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ \\widehat{y}_f = X_f \\widehat{\\beta}_f $ and $ \\widehat{y}_r = X_r \\widehat{\\beta}_r $ are the predicted means under the full and reduced models. For large sample sizes, this test statistic follows a $ \\chi^2 $ distribution with $ n_f - n_r $ degrees of freedom, where $ n_f $ and $ n_r $ are the degrees of freedom for the full and reduced models, respectively.",
